{"id":"forecast-19","section":3,"path":"bank/listening/forecast-19/audio-3.m4a","model":"small","duration":418.47,"segments":[{"start":0.08,"end":8.1,"text":"Section 3. You will hear two students called Mona and Tom discussing Mona's recent work","words":[["Section",0.08,0.7],["3.",0.7,1.18],["You",1.8,2.52],["will",2.52,2.7],["hear",2.7,2.9],["two",2.9,3.22],["students",3.22,3.84],["called",3.84,4.28],["Mona",4.28,4.7],["and",4.7,5.26],["Tom",5.26,5.62],["discussing",5.62,6.54],["Mona's",6.54,7.38],["recent",7.38,7.84],["work",7.84,8.1]]},{"start":8.1,"end":17.44,"text":"experience in a hotel. First you have some time to look at questions 21-26 on page 5.","words":[["experience",8.1,8.88],["in",8.88,9.42],["a",9.42,9.54],["hotel.",9.54,9.96],["First",11.06,11.62],["you",11.62,12.32],["have",12.32,12.5],["some",12.5,12.7],["time",12.7,13.12],["to",13.12,13.34],["look",13.34,13.48],["at",13.48,13.6],["questions",13.6,13.94],["21",13.94,14.8],["-26",14.8,15.6],["on",15.6,16.54],["page",16.54,16.84],["5.",16.84,17.44]]},{"start":47.9,"end":52.36,"text":"Now listen carefully and answer questions 21-26.","words":[["Now",47.9,48.14],["listen",48.14,48.46],["carefully",48.46,48.96],["and",48.96,49.88],["answer",49.88,50.2],["questions",50.2,50.62],["21",50.62,51.52],["-26.",51.52,52.36]]},{"start":56.13,"end":63.53,"text":"Hi Tom. I'm exhausted. I've just finished my work experience week at the hotel in the centre of town.","words":[["Hi",56.13,56.61],["Tom.",56.61,56.97],["I'm",57.77,58.25],["exhausted.",58.25,58.67],["I've",59.49,59.85],["just",59.85,60.01],["finished",60.01,60.29],["my",60.29,60.55],["work",60.55,60.83],["experience",60.83,61.21],["week",61.21,61.75],["at",61.75,62.01],["the",62.01,62.11],["hotel",62.11,62.45],["in",62.45,62.67],["the",62.67,62.81],["centre",62.81,63.03],["of",63.03,63.23],["town.",63.23,63.53]]},{"start":63.87,"end":66.23,"text":"Oh, how did it go? Did you do a lot?","words":[["Oh,",63.87,64.15],["how",64.29,64.47],["did",64.47,64.61],["it",64.61,64.75],["go?",64.75,64.95],["Did",65.55,65.77],["you",65.77,65.89],["do",65.89,66.01],["a",66.01,66.13],["lot?",66.13,66.23]]},{"start":66.61,"end":72.43,"text":"Yeah. It was a very good programme actually because they let me work in all the different departments.","words":[["Yeah.",66.61,66.97],["It",67.69,67.93],["was",67.93,68.07],["a",68.07,68.19],["very",68.19,68.37],["good",68.37,68.53],["programme",68.53,69.05],["actually",69.05,69.47],["because",69.47,70.03],["they",70.03,70.23],["let",70.23,70.37],["me",70.37,70.57],["work",70.57,70.81],["in",70.81,70.99],["all",70.99,71.27],["the",71.27,71.43],["different",71.43,71.79],["departments.",71.79,72.43]]},{"start":72.81,"end":75.85,"text":"Oh, brilliant. So tell me all about it.","words":[["Oh,",72.81,73.03],["brilliant.",73.15,73.51],["So",74.47,74.81],["tell",74.81,75.13],["me",75.13,75.27],["all",75.27,75.37],["about",75.37,75.57],["it.",75.57,75.85]]},{"start":76.43,"end":83.53,"text":"Well, first of all they put me on reception for a morning and I thought, oh, I know what this is all about.","words":[["Well,",76.43,76.91],["first",77.57,77.87],["of",77.87,78.11],["all",78.11,78.29],["they",78.29,78.47],["put",78.47,78.67],["me",78.67,78.83],["on",78.83,78.99],["reception",78.99,79.39],["for",79.39,79.77],["a",79.77,79.91],["morning",79.91,80.17],["and",80.17,80.85],["I",80.85,81.05],["thought,",81.05,81.23],["oh,",81.69,81.91],["I",82.09,82.25],["know",82.25,82.47],["what",82.47,82.67],["this",82.67,82.91],["is",82.91,83.03],["all",83.03,83.23],["about.",83.23,83.53]]},{"start":83.53,"end":86.49,"text":"it'll just be handing out keys and stuff.","words":[["it'll",83.53,84.43],["just",84.43,84.67],["be",84.67,84.87],["handing",84.87,85.19],["out",85.19,85.49],["keys",85.49,85.91],["and",85.91,86.17],["stuff.",86.17,86.49]]},{"start":87.33,"end":89.01,"text":"How wrong I was!","words":[["How",87.33,87.71],["wrong",87.71,88.17],["I",88.17,88.57],["was!",88.57,89.01]]},{"start":89.89,"end":93.17,"text":"In fact, they handle loads of different things there.","words":[["In",89.89,90.11],["fact,",90.11,90.41],["they",90.77,90.91],["handle",90.91,91.31],["loads",91.31,91.73],["of",91.73,92.01],["different",92.01,92.35],["things",92.35,92.83],["there.",92.83,93.17]]},{"start":93.59,"end":97.19,"text":"Special requests, contractors coming in and so on.","words":[["Special",93.59,93.99],["requests,",93.99,94.55],["contractors",95.07,95.59],["coming",95.59,96.07],["in",96.07,96.45],["and",96.45,96.67],["so",96.67,96.93],["on.",96.93,97.19]]},{"start":97.39,"end":98.63,"text":"What did you do in the afternoon?","words":[["What",97.39,97.59],["did",97.59,97.77],["you",97.77,97.89],["do",97.89,98.05],["in",98.05,98.17],["the",98.17,98.25],["afternoon?",98.25,98.63]]},{"start":99.29,"end":104.59,"text":"Well, in the afternoon and evening, in fact, I was in the hotel restaurant.","words":[["Well,",99.29,99.81],["in",100.15,100.35],["the",100.35,100.45],["afternoon",100.45,101.05],["and",101.05,101.51],["evening,",101.51,101.99],["in",102.13,102.25],["fact,",102.25,102.55],["I",102.99,103.17],["was",103.17,103.35],["in",103.35,103.51],["the",103.51,103.61],["hotel",103.61,103.93],["restaurant.",103.93,104.59]]},{"start":105.29,"end":108.51,"text":"There were loads of staff there, so it wasn't too exhausting.","words":[["There",105.29,105.55],["were",105.55,105.67],["loads",105.67,105.89],["of",105.89,106.09],["staff",106.09,106.35],["there,",106.35,106.75],["so",107.05,107.29],["it",107.29,107.43],["wasn't",107.43,107.75],["too",107.75,107.95],["exhausting.",107.95,108.51]]},{"start":108.51,"end":115.85,"text":"but the manager really wanted everything done absolutely precisely, really focused on the guests.","words":[["but",108.51,109.27],["the",109.27,109.45],["manager",109.45,109.85],["really",109.85,110.31],["wanted",110.31,110.71],["everything",110.71,111.35],["done",111.35,111.81],["absolutely",111.81,112.63],["precisely,",112.63,113.57],["really",114.11,114.55],["focused",114.55,114.95],["on",114.95,115.27],["the",115.27,115.41],["guests.",115.41,115.85]]},{"start":116.43,"end":118.23,"text":"You weren't allowed to make any mistakes.","words":[["You",116.43,116.67],["weren't",116.67,116.91],["allowed",116.91,117.17],["to",117.17,117.37],["make",117.37,117.55],["any",117.55,117.79],["mistakes.",117.79,118.23]]},{"start":119.11,"end":124.33,"text":"I thought it was a bit over the top actually, not very enjoyable to work in.","words":[["I",119.11,119.53],["thought",119.53,119.81],["it",119.81,120.15],["was",120.15,120.31],["a",120.31,120.45],["bit",120.45,120.57],["over",120.57,120.87],["the",120.87,121.03],["top",121.03,121.41],["actually,",121.41,121.85],["not",122.35,122.65],["very",122.65,122.99],["enjoyable",122.99,123.51],["to",123.51,123.79],["work",123.79,124.05],["in.",124.05,124.33]]},{"start":124.69,"end":127.09,"text":"But they've got a really nice coffee bar at that hotel.","words":[["But",124.69,124.93],["they've",124.93,125.21],["got",125.21,125.33],["a",125.33,125.49],["really",125.49,125.65],["nice",125.65,125.87],["coffee",125.87,126.21],["bar",126.21,126.49],["at",126.49,126.67],["that",126.67,126.77],["hotel.",126.77,127.09]]},{"start":127.69,"end":129.25,"text":"Did you get a chance to work in that?","words":[["Did",127.69,127.99],["you",127.99,128.11],["get",128.11,128.21],["a",128.21,128.29],["chance",128.29,128.49],["to",128.49,128.65],["work",128.65,128.85],["in",128.85,129.03],["that?",129.03,129.25]]},{"start":129.57,"end":132.77,"text":"Yeah, the next morning. You're right, it is nice.","words":[["Yeah,",129.57,129.93],["the",130.33,130.51],["next",130.51,130.73],["morning.",130.73,131.09],["You're",131.57,131.81],["right,",131.81,132.01],["it",132.21,132.29],["is",132.29,132.49],["nice.",132.49,132.77]]},{"start":133.11,"end":134.63,"text":"But I bet it gets really busy.","words":[["But",133.11,133.27],["I",133.27,133.41],["bet",133.41,133.55],["it",133.55,133.69],["gets",133.69,133.91],["really",133.91,134.27],["busy.",134.27,134.63]]},{"start":134.63,"end":141.51,"text":"It wasn't too bad actually but there's a lot of running around so I was worn out afterwards","words":[["It",134.63,135.45],["wasn't",135.45,135.99],["too",135.99,136.21],["bad",136.21,136.59],["actually",136.59,137.03],["but",137.03,137.83],["there's",137.83,138.39],["a",138.39,138.55],["lot",138.55,138.75],["of",138.75,138.95],["running",138.95,139.17],["around",139.17,139.67],["so",139.67,140.21],["I",140.21,140.37],["was",140.37,140.53],["worn",140.53,140.81],["out",140.81,141.03],["afterwards",141.03,141.51]]},{"start":141.99,"end":144.09,"text":"and then I had to go to work in the shop.","words":[["and",141.99,142.23],["then",142.23,142.47],["I",142.47,142.69],["had",142.69,142.79],["to",142.79,142.93],["go",142.93,143.07],["to",143.07,143.23],["work",143.23,143.45],["in",143.45,143.65],["the",143.65,143.75],["shop.",143.75,144.09]]},{"start":144.89,"end":148.99,"text":"It's interesting to see how shops fit into the overall hotel culture.","words":[["It's",144.89,145.19],["interesting",145.19,145.55],["to",145.55,145.79],["see",145.79,146.01],["how",146.01,146.21],["shops",146.21,146.61],["fit",146.61,146.91],["into",146.91,147.29],["the",147.29,147.47],["overall",147.47,147.93],["hotel",147.93,148.33],["culture.",148.33,148.99]]},{"start":149.47,"end":153.29,"text":"I never know who goes in those hotel shops but they must be worth it.","words":[["I",149.47,149.55],["never",149.55,149.73],["know",149.73,149.91],["who",149.91,150.13],["goes",150.13,150.37],["in",150.37,150.61],["those",150.61,150.85],["hotel",150.85,151.25],["shops",151.25,151.77],["but",151.77,152.31],["they",152.31,152.41],["must",152.41,152.53],["be",152.53,152.71],["worth",152.71,152.99],["it.",152.99,153.29]]},{"start":153.95,"end":156.23,"text":"I suppose they're owned separately from the hotel though.","words":[["I",153.95,154.05],["suppose",154.05,154.29],["they're",154.29,154.55],["owned",154.55,154.73],["separately",154.73,155.19],["from",155.19,155.53],["the",155.53,155.65],["hotel",155.65,156.01],["though.",156.01,156.23]]},{"start":156.73,"end":157.29,"text":"Think so.","words":[["Think",156.73,157.01],["so.",157.01,157.29]]},{"start":157.83,"end":162.25,"text":"Anyway, there were loads of staff working there but we still couldn't keep up with","words":[["Anyway,",157.83,158.31],["there",158.75,159.05],["were",159.05,159.17],["loads",159.17,159.41],["of",159.41,159.59],["staff",159.59,159.79],["working",159.79,160.25],["there",160.25,160.63],["but",160.63,160.97],["we",160.97,161.11],["still",161.11,161.35],["couldn't",161.35,161.77],["keep",161.77,161.91],["up",161.91,162.11],["with",162.11,162.25]]},{"start":162.25,"end":167.45,"text":"the floor of customers, because nobody knew where anything was or what they were supposed","words":[["the",162.25,162.35],["floor",162.35,162.61],["of",162.61,162.77],["customers,",162.77,163.25],["because",163.69,163.93],["nobody",163.93,164.49],["knew",164.49,164.87],["where",164.87,165.13],["anything",165.13,165.61],["was",165.61,166.01],["or",166.01,166.67],["what",166.67,166.93],["they",166.93,167.03],["were",167.03,167.15],["supposed",167.15,167.45]]},{"start":167.45,"end":174.85,"text":"to be doing. I was quite relieved when it was over. Then, the next day, I went to see what","words":[["to",167.45,167.75],["be",167.75,167.83],["doing.",167.83,168.17],["I",168.93,169.27],["was",169.27,169.49],["quite",169.49,169.81],["relieved",169.81,170.25],["when",170.25,170.55],["it",170.55,170.69],["was",170.69,170.83],["over.",170.83,171.11],["Then,",172.17,172.63],["the",172.85,172.99],["next",172.99,173.25],["day,",173.25,173.61],["I",173.97,174.11],["went",174.11,174.29],["to",174.29,174.49],["see",174.49,174.67],["what",174.67,174.85]]},{"start":174.85,"end":178.27,"text":"the personal services department did. Fascinating.","words":[["the",174.85,175.01],["personal",175.01,175.41],["services",175.41,176.05],["department",176.05,176.47],["did.",176.47,176.99],["Fascinating.",177.75,178.27]]},{"start":178.45,"end":183.73,"text":"Yes, they seem to mop up everything else, don't they? And you must have to be a certain","words":[["Yes,",178.45,178.91],["they",179.53,179.75],["seem",179.75,179.99],["to",179.99,180.13],["mop",180.13,180.41],["up",180.41,180.63],["everything",180.63,180.97],["else,",180.97,181.37],["don't",181.47,181.69],["they?",181.69,181.93],["And",182.41,182.67],["you",182.67,182.79],["must",182.79,182.93],["have",182.93,183.11],["to",183.11,183.21],["be",183.21,183.33],["a",183.33,183.47],["certain",183.47,183.73]]},{"start":183.73,"end":189.33,"text":"sort of person because to handle the requests and some of the people that make them, you","words":[["sort",183.73,184.03],["of",184.03,184.23],["person",184.23,184.65],["because",184.65,184.99],["to",184.99,185.43],["handle",185.43,185.65],["the",185.65,185.83],["requests",185.83,186.45],["and",186.45,186.95],["some",186.95,187.23],["of",187.23,187.33],["the",187.33,187.45],["people",187.45,187.71],["that",187.71,187.93],["make",187.93,188.25],["them,",188.25,188.55],["you",189.07,189.33]]},{"start":189.33,"end":194.57,"text":"to keep calm and polite and be quite imaginative to find a way round them and resolve them.","words":[["to",189.33,189.51],["keep",189.51,189.65],["calm",189.65,190.07],["and",190.07,190.21],["polite",190.21,190.59],["and",190.59,191.49],["be",191.49,191.63],["quite",191.63,191.81],["imaginative",191.81,192.45],["to",192.45,192.65],["find",192.65,192.85],["a",192.85,192.97],["way",192.97,193.07],["round",193.07,193.39],["them",193.39,193.61],["and",193.61,193.95],["resolve",193.95,194.27],["them.",194.27,194.57]]},{"start":194.83,"end":201.49,"text":"Absolutely. I couldn't do it. It was beyond me, so I just sat and watched and listened.","words":[["Absolutely.",194.83,195.35],["I",196.15,196.45],["couldn't",196.45,196.87],["do",196.87,197.11],["it.",197.11,197.31],["It",197.77,197.87],["was",197.87,197.99],["beyond",197.99,198.35],["me,",198.35,198.79],["so",198.87,199.47],["I",199.47,199.71],["just",199.71,199.91],["sat",199.91,200.25],["and",200.25,200.47],["watched",200.47,200.89],["and",200.89,201.17],["listened.",201.17,201.49]]},{"start":201.97,"end":204.99,"text":"Didn't you have to go with the domestic staff and do cleaning at all?","words":[["Didn't",201.97,202.27],["you",202.27,202.39],["have",202.39,202.53],["to",202.53,202.65],["go",202.65,202.79],["with",202.79,202.97],["the",202.97,203.09],["domestic",203.09,203.45],["staff",203.45,203.83],["and",203.83,204.09],["do",204.09,204.25],["cleaning",204.25,204.57],["at",204.57,204.81],["all?",204.81,204.99]]},{"start":205.41,"end":213.03,"text":"Oh yes, my last day. I was dreading it. I just thought cleaning all those rooms would be so","words":[["Oh",205.41,205.73],["yes,",205.73,206.35],["my",206.75,206.89],["last",206.89,207.27],["day.",207.27,207.65],["I",208.21,208.45],["was",208.45,208.63],["dreading",208.63,209.23],["it.",209.23,209.45],["I",209.95,210.23],["just",210.23,210.47],["thought",210.47,210.71],["cleaning",210.71,211.43],["all",211.43,211.79],["those",211.79,211.99],["rooms",211.99,212.43],["would",212.43,212.67],["be",212.67,212.81],["so",212.81,213.03]]},{"start":213.03,"end":219.17,"text":"repetitive and tedious. Actually the girls that do it are really lively and good fun.","words":[["repetitive",213.03,213.65],["and",213.65,213.95],["tedious.",213.95,214.37],["Actually",215.29,215.85],["the",215.85,216.45],["girls",216.45,216.77],["that",216.77,216.97],["do",216.97,217.21],["it",217.21,217.37],["are",217.37,217.59],["really",217.59,217.89],["lively",217.89,218.37],["and",218.37,218.67],["good",218.67,218.85],["fun.",218.85,219.17]]},{"start":219.95,"end":226.41,"text":"But by the end of the morning my ears were ringing, the row of the vacuum cleaners, trolleys","words":[["But",219.95,220.25],["by",220.25,220.53],["the",220.53,220.65],["end",220.65,220.87],["of",220.87,220.99],["the",220.99,221.07],["morning",221.07,221.41],["my",221.41,221.93],["ears",221.93,222.39],["were",222.39,222.63],["ringing,",222.63,222.97],["the",223.69,223.81],["row",223.81,224.21],["of",224.21,224.47],["the",224.47,224.61],["vacuum",224.61,225.03],["cleaners,",225.03,225.73],["trolleys",225.99,226.41]]},{"start":226.41,"end":231.81,"text":"going up and down and the girls shouting at each other. I was amazed the guests didn't","words":[["going",226.41,226.65],["up",226.65,226.95],["and",226.95,227.09],["down",227.09,227.43],["and",227.43,227.67],["the",227.67,227.81],["girls",227.81,228.17],["shouting",228.17,228.71],["at",228.71,228.97],["each",228.97,229.17],["other.",229.17,229.43],["I",230.09,230.27],["was",230.27,230.41],["amazed",230.41,230.77],["the",230.77,231.11],["guests",231.11,231.43],["didn't",231.43,231.81]]},{"start":231.81,"end":237.74,"text":"complain. Before you hear the rest of the discussion,","words":[["complain.",231.81,232.23],["Before",235.74,236.14],["you",236.14,236.4],["hear",236.4,236.62],["the",236.62,236.78],["rest",236.78,237.02],["of",237.02,237.16],["the",237.16,237.26],["discussion,",237.26,237.74]]},{"start":237.74,"end":243.86,"text":"You have some time to look at questions 27 to 30 on page 6.","words":[["You",237.74,238.6],["have",238.6,238.82],["some",238.82,239.02],["time",239.02,239.48],["to",239.48,239.98],["look",239.98,240.14],["at",240.14,240.26],["questions",240.26,240.6],["27",240.6,241.62],["to",241.62,241.86],["30",241.86,242.32],["on",242.32,243.06],["page",243.06,243.36],["6.",243.36,243.86]]},{"start":264.12,"end":268.16,"text":"Now listen and answer questions 27 to 30.","words":[["Now",264.12,264.46],["listen",264.46,264.94],["and",264.94,265.64],["answer",265.64,266.0],["questions",266.0,266.38],["27",266.38,267.48],["to",267.48,267.74],["30.",267.74,268.16]]},{"start":271.53,"end":273.51,"text":"So what's your assessment overall?","words":[["So",271.53,271.97],["what's",271.97,272.41],["your",272.41,272.53],["assessment",272.53,2